# CRN

> News, analysis, and channel awards for IT solution providers, MSPs, and technology vendors.

CRN publishes editorial news plus annual awards and rankings (Channel Chiefs, Women of the Channel, Partner Program Guide, SP 500, and related lists). Winner profile pages use query URLs (`?c={Pkey}`) on `*-details` pages and load structured rows from public spreadsheet JSON under `/data-source/`.

## News and sitemaps

- https://www.crn.com/sitemap-index.xml
- https://www.crn.com/filter-details-sitemap.xml
- https://www.crn.com/news/rss.xml

## Awards and lists (machine-readable data)

Public JSON used by awards/lists UIs (sheet query param selects the year). Prefer these when citing list membership or profile fields:

- https://www.crn.com/data-source/cc/cc-data.json
- https://www.crn.com/data-source/ppg/ppg-data.json
- https://www.crn.com/data-source/sp/sp-data.json
- https://www.crn.com/data-source/msp/msp-data.json
- https://www.crn.com/data-source/ceo/ceo-data.json
- https://www.crn.com/data-source/wotc2/wotc2-data.json
- https://www.crn.com/data-source/wotc/wotc-data.json

Example: `https://www.crn.com/data-source/cc/cc-data.json?sheet=2026`

